MACRO                                                                           
WY2000P5. PROC                                                                  
                                                                                
*---  ADJUST TWO DATE FIELDS IN YY-P FORMAT                                     
*---  (1/8TH YEAR PROGRAM PERIOD - 3 DIGITS)                                    
*---  SO DATES BETWEEN 1950-2049 COME IN ASCENDING SEQUENCE.                    
*---  VALUE ZERO IS CONSIDERED A NON-DATE AND NOT ADJUSTED.                     
                                                                                
     IF TMP1-YYP NOT ZERO AND +                                                 
        TMP1-YYP < 999                                                          
       IF TMP1-YYP < 500                                                        
         TMP1-YYP = TMP1-YYP + 500                                              
       ELSE                                                                     
         TMP1-YYP = TMP1-YYP - 500                                              
       END-IF                                                                   
     END-IF                                                                     
                                                                                
     IF TMP2-YYP NOT ZERO AND +                                                 
        TMP2-YYP < 999                                                          
       IF TMP2-YYP < 500                                                        
         TMP2-YYP = TMP2-YYP + 500                                              
       ELSE                                                                     
         TMP2-YYP = TMP2-YYP - 500                                              
       END-IF                                                                   
     END-IF                                                                     
                                                                                
END-PROC                                                                        
